              "source": "[YOU SAY: *pracāraṇaṁ*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "tiraññeṭuppŭ pracāraṇaṁ innale avasāniccu. — The election campaign ended yesterday.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *tiraññeṭuppŭ pracāraṇaṁ innale avasāniccu.* — The election campaign ended yesterday.]"
